00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:27.791
<v Host>Sixty years old — the oldest African elephant in Japan.

00:07:28.391 --> 00:07:33.911
<v Slow>メアリーは、どこの動物園にいますか。

00:07:34.711 --> 00:07:37.495
<v Host>The Yagiyama Zoo, in Sendai City.

00:07:38.096 --> 00:07:43.160
<v Slow>メアリーの大好きな食べ物は何ですか。

00:07:43.959 --> 00:07:47.728
<v Host>Fruit — she still eats her favorite fruit every day.

00:07:48.327 --> 00:07:55.791
<v Host>That's all for today. Happy sixtieth birthday, Mary — here's to many more healthy years. See you next time.

00:07:56.391 --> 00:07:58.791
<v News>また明日。
